# conversation-v1: the data of the situations (DS023 "Conversation layer"): priorities (per part, the highest applicable one is used)
# and the pragmatic kinds that select a courtesy reply, an opening, a closing or the short style. The kinds are sop/enums.mjs PRAGMATIC_KINDS.

@cv_d1 fact
  holds cv_situation_priority answer_found 100
